codium (1.140.06880) snipe; urgency=medium

  * Build VSCodium 1.140.06880 for UOS 25 (snipe) from a root-level debian/
    directory, so the package can be produced with the standard tooling
    (dpkg-buildpackage, pbuilder) instead of the upstream gulp deb task.
  * Do not register Microsoft's apt repository in postinst. Upstream's guard is
    `if [ "@@NAME@@" != "code-oss" ]`, which is always true for VSCodium, so the
    stock package writes packages.microsoft.com into the apt configuration -
    unreachable from a UOS network, which breaks every later `apt update`.
  * Drop the matching postrm cleanup and the debconf question, so the package
    ships no debconf templates.

